# This dependency-free defensive demo needs no configuration and no API keys —
# it runs on the standard library alone. This file is a placeholder for a
# production version that might front the detector with a classifier model or a
# platform prompt-shield:
#
# MODEL_API_KEY=<your-model-provider-api-key>
# CONTENT_SAFETY_ENDPOINT=<your-azure-ai-content-safety-endpoint>
#
# Copy to .env and fill in only if you wire in a live service. Never commit .env.
